

### Get restaurant orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders

### Get pending orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders/pending

### Get order by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders/1

### Update order status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Delete order
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders/1